<title>LITHUANIA: SALARIES RISE IN MARCH.</title>
<headline>SALARIES RISE IN MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's statistics department said on Thursday that average monthly gross wages and salaries rose to 753.49 litas in March from to 696.5 litas in February.  </p>
<p>The statistics department also said in a statement that the average gross salary in the public sector increased to 802 litas in March compared to 727 litas in February.</p>
<p>It added that the average gross salary in the private sector rose to 678 litas in March versus 648 litas a month before.</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
